WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.320
But once again, Trump is lifting up Americans,

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:04.240
including his opponents.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:08.520
Guys that look like David Hogg, or a hog, period,

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.800
are going to the gym now just to beat Trump.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.780
But this gym, it could be a doorway

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.100
to the logic of hard work.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.639
Maybe the left won't resent people that succeed

00:00:18.639 --> 00:00:21.600
if they see what happens when they succeed.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.120
How soon before they discover other healthy habits

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:27.000
like proper hygiene and not eating your body weight

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.320
in bear claws?

